{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33863","headline":"石榴歌 · 皮日休","name":"石榴歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蝉噪秋枝槐叶黄，石榴香老愁寒霜。\n流霞包染紫鹦粟，黄蜡纸裹红瓠房。\n玉刻冰壶含露湿，斓斑似带湘娥泣。\n萧娘初嫁嗜甘酸，嚼破水精千万粒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}